import ../../helpers/driver.dl

window text test:
    label "Select this text"
    text field "Name" containing "Aé🙂B"

set state to 0
set instance to an instance of text test with state (the address of state)
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 640 by 480 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set field to the UI layout for element (the control labeled "Name" in (the address of instance)) in (view's layout)
set x to field's painted bounds' x + 42.0
set y to field's painted bounds' y + 20.0
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at x y with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's selection's caret = 8) reporting "Pointer selection did not use Unicode character advances"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the selected UI text in (the address of view)) = "B") reporting "Shift-left did not extend selection"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 67 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set surface to view's window as a pointer to test UI surface
require condition (surface's copied = "🙂B") reporting "Copy split a UTF-8 character"
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "界" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text) = "Aé界") reporting "Text insertion did not replace the selection"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 259 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text) = "Aé") reporting "Backspace did not delete a complete Unicode scalar"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 65 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 88 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (surface's copied = "Aé") reporting "Cut did not copy the field"
require condition (((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text) = "") reporting "Cut did not empty the field"
set long to the string form of ""
set index to 0
loop while index < 200:
    set long to long + "a"
    increment index
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing long in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (field's scroll position > 0.0) reporting "Long editable text did not scroll to the caret"
set the text of "Name" in (the address of instance) to "Ok"
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (field's scroll position = 0.0) reporting "Shortening a field left its text outside the viewport"
require condition (view's selection's caret = 2) reporting "A programmatic edit left the caret beyond the text"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 65 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 6 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "á" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (((the UI value for (field's node) in (the address of instance))'s text) = "Oká") reporting "AltGr was interpreted as a command shortcut"
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Shared Unicode selection, copy, cut, insertion and deletion work."
